### Sample API requests
### TODO: fill with real request/response pairs once the endpoints work.

### 1. Create a user profile
POST http://localhost:8000/users
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "user_id": "user-123",
  "name": "Rahul",
  "dob": "1995-08-15",
  "tob": "09:30",
  "birth_place": "Delhi",
  "language": "en"
}

### 2. First message — states a goal worth remembering
POST http://localhost:8000/chat
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "user_id": "user-123",
  "session_id": "session-456",
  "message": "My name is Rahul. I was born on 15 August 1995 in Delhi. I'm planning to switch jobs next year."
}

### 3. Uses the stored goal
POST http://localhost:8000/chat
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "user_id": "user-123",
  "session_id": "session-456",
  "message": "What should I focus on for my career?"
}

### 4. Follow-up — should use short-term context only
POST http://localhost:8000/chat
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "user_id": "user-123",
  "session_id": "session-456",
  "message": "Why do you say that?"
}

### 5. New session — must recall from the Shared Brain
POST http://localhost:8000/chat
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "user_id": "user-123",
  "session_id": "session-999",
  "message": "What do you remember about my career goals?"
}

### 6. Inspect the Shared Brain
GET http://localhost:8000/users/user-123/brain
